# Compiler/link objects only ever appear under the already-ignored build dirs
# (build*/, out/, deploy/). Root-anchor the object rule so the only stray objects
# it catches are at the repo root — notably Windows' reserved-device NUL.obj —
# while Wavefront mesh assets (*.obj) in module/asset subdirs stay tracked.
/*.obj
CMakeUserPresets.json
